  "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Asset type: Japanese elementary vocabulary illustrations, sheet 23. Edit the provided 2048x2048 template, painting ONLY inside its sixteen white panels. Every single panel MUST have identical width and height. All horizontal lines must be EXACTLY at 0%,25%,50%,75%,100%, not based on artwork. Keep precisely the 4x4 equal grid and 5 continuous pure magenta #ff00ff lines in each direction, including outer frame. Preserve line position, width and full canvas. Each panel is an independent clear gentle picture-book illustration as isolated vignettes on a pure white background, large and easily understood. Never use magenta for illustration. Avoid all pink, purple and neon colors in artwork, objects, decorations, lighting and shadows. Use warm orange, red, yellow, green, blue and neutral colors. No pink/purple concert lights. Nothing crosses the grid. No text, letters, numbers, labels, symbols resembling writing or watermarks. For abstract words show a concrete situation illustrating the meaning. Diverse natural children and adults, no stereotypes. Correct anatomy and objects. Panels in strict row-major order (left to right, top to bottom):\n1. 勝ち星 — 勝った試合を数えるときの勝ち一つ分。\n2. 勝ち負け — 勝つことと負けること。\n3. 活気 — 元気があってにぎやかな様子。\n4. 褐色 — 黒みや黄色みのある茶色。\n5. 滑走 — 地面や雪などの上を滑るように進むこと。\n6. 滑走路 — 飛行機が飛び立ったり着陸したりするときに走る道。\n7. カッター — 紙などを切るための刃を出し入れできる道具。\n8. カット — 物などを切ること。\n9. 活用 — 持っている物や力を役立てて使うこと。\n10. 家庭教師 — 家庭などに来て勉強を教える先生。\n11. カテゴリー — 同じ種類としてまとめた区分。\n12. 門松 — 正月に家の門口などに立てる松や竹の飾り。\n13. 金具 — 物をつないだり留めたりする金属の部品。\n14. 仮名遣い — 言葉を仮名で書き表すときの決まり。\n15. 要 — 物事のいちばん大切なところ。\n16. 加入 — 団体や仕組みなどの仲間に入ること。\nSafety and clarity: Vehicles must be driven only by unmistakable adults, never children. Industrial machinery and knives are used by adults. Do not put a child in a car driver's seat. Keep artwork separated by the measured template grid.\n",
